<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8107"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 9:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->On AMW forum a poster claimed to be BTK stated he killed a woman last month, I think I found her. This is my message to BTK: <BR> <BR>BTK <BR> <BR>You killed MELISSA SKOTT!!!! mother of 4 children <BR> <BR>And the police and media have done everything to keept it a secret!!! <BR> <BR>You killed her january 31, 2005on the aniversery of the &#34;Curly Lock&#34; poem to Shirley Vian &#40;january 31 1978&#41; <BR> <BR>6 days after you drop in Vally Center <BR> <BR>She was found 9.30 in the morning with all the children at home just like Shirley Vian. <BR> <BR>Here it is: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1107462969820" target=_top>http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1107462 969820</a> <BR> <BR>Woman, 27, found dead at home in VC <BR> <BR>A Valley Center woman was found dead Monday morning in her home at 409 E. Main. <BR> <BR>Valley Center police responded to a 911 call with information that a boy had found his mother unconscious. Police reached the home and attempted to treat Melissa Scott, 27, with CPR before EMS personnel arrived. <BR> <BR>Scott later was pronounced dead at the scene. Her four children, ranging in age from 3 to 10, also were present. Her roommate was not at home. <BR> <BR>Sgt. Lloyd Newman of the Valley Center Police Department said the woman had lived in Valley Center a short time. He declined to comment on the nature of her injuries. <BR> <BR>“The cause of death is pending on autopsy results,” said Newman. <BR> <BR>He added that he expects to receive results in six to eight weeks. Newman declined to comment about whether Scott’s death was suspicious, but he said rumors that it was related to the serial killer BTK were untrue. <BR> <BR>The emergency call was received about 9:30 a.m. Monday. Newman said the four children are with other family members. <BR> <BR>The case is under investigation. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1108066942359" target=_top>http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1108066 942359</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
